Law1 LinkedLatest; law2 InitialCause uses first linked cause, retaining later evidence;
law3 CurrentBeliefOnly substitutes1-current willingness for incident cause;
law4 NoLearning disables both journal updates; law5 TruthOracle reads hidden current
source truth for harm/cause/willingness, explicitly violating epistemic boundaries.
Six models: laws1..5 Goal1, law1 Goal2. No universal update law selected.

Freeze models, run inputs, ExperimentIdentity and ComparisonCase before qualification.
Require fixed event/different later explanation; false revision at fixed truth;
no explanation, denied, missing link, foreign incident/target; two observers; same
current willingness with different attribution; willingness-only intervention;
frozen outputs; whole later privacy including common subsequent receipt;
no-revision/current-belief-only/NoLearning/Oracle competitors; actual phases,
every complete-prefix continuation, fault all13 stages plus commit during real
history/knowledge updates, malformed input/save and cross-owner rejection.
